<section class="rocket-intro wrap" id="about-rocketchat"><div class="section-kicker">THE PLATFORM BEHIND THE CONVERSATION</div><div><h2>Meet Rocket.Chat.</h2><p>Rocket.Chat is a communication platform that brings channels, direct messages and file sharing into one workspace. Teams and communities can host it on their own infrastructure.</p><p>AmiRocket connects your Amiga to those workspaces. It is an independent client, not the Rocket.Chat server or an official Rocket.Chat application.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.rocket.chat/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the official Rocket.Chat website <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="intro wrap" id="features"><div class="section-kicker">01 / THE CLIENT</div><div><h2>Old-school soul.<br>Everyday conversation.</h2><p class="section-lead">No browser required. AmiRocket connects to your Rocket.Chat workspaces through a native Amiga interface, with the details that make chat useful.</p></div></section>
<section class="feature-grid wrap" aria-label="Client features">
<article><span class="feature-number">01</span><h3>One tree. All your people.</h3><p>Multiple servers, favourite rooms and direct messages in one sidebar. Connect each workspace on demand or automatically at startup.</p></article>
<article><span class="feature-number">02</span><h3>Keep the conversation moving.</h3><p>Mentions, unread markers and older message history. Write multiline messages, share code and copy text from the conversation.</p></article>
<article><span class="feature-number">03</span><h3>Images, on your terms.</h3><p>Expand an image when you want to see it. Download attachments with progress and cancellation, and open links in your configured browser.</p></article>
<article><span class="feature-number">04</span><h3>Make room for your machine.</h3><p>Choose fonts and themes. Switch avatars and emoji images on or off, adjust polling, or iconify the client while staying connected.</p></article>
</section>
